---
import { topics } from '../data/topics';
---

<section class="relative py-14 md:py-24">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:mb-14 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <p class="coord pt-1">00 / Lenses</p>
      <div>
        <h1 class="section-heading max-w-3xl text-4xl md:text-6xl">
          Three lenses, one operating system.
        </h1>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg">
          The throughline is not a job title. It is a habit: look behind the visible surface, find
          the overlooked system, document it clearly, and turn it into something useful. Entertainment,
          geospatial intelligence, and finance are the places that habit keeps showing up.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      {topics.map((topic, index) => (
        <a
          href={`/${topic.slug}`}
          class="surface-quiet group block rounded-md p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/55 hover:bg-paper-soft md:p-6"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="coord text-accent">{topic.label}</p>
              <p class="coord mt-2">{topic.signal}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="mono rounded-sm border border-hairline bg-paper-soft px-2 py-1 text-xs text-ink-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
              {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
            </span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="mt-10 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">
            {topic.title}
          </h2>
          <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-sm md:text-base">
            {topic.dek}
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 border-t border-hairline pt-4">
            {topic.evidence.map((item) => (
              <li class="grid grid-cols-[1.2rem_1fr] gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <span class="mono text-accent" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                <span>{item}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <span class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-accent">
            Open lens <span class="mono text-xs transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">-&gt;</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="dossier-panel mt-5 rounded-lg p-5 md:mt-6 md:p-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] md:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="coord text-signal">Tool layer</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-sans text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink">
            AI connects the lenses.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-copy text-base md:text-lg">
          The destination is not “AI person” as a standalone identity. The stronger framing is AI as
          the working layer for maps, markets, media, research, automation, and product building.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
